import ../../../ui/scene_instances.dl
import ../../../ui/scene_instance_picking.dl
import ../../../ui/scene_surfaces.dl

to check model number {a number:actual} equals {a number:expected}:
    require condition ((the absolute value of (actual - expected)) < 0.00001) reporting "A shared scene model component changed."

to check model point {vector:actual} equals {vector:expected}:
    check model number (the length of (actual - expected)) equals 0.0

set origin to a new vector with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0
set one to a new vector with x 1.0, y 1.0 and z 1.0
set identity to an identity UI scene pose
set pose to a UI scene pose at (a new vector with x 1.0, y 2.0 and z 3.0) rotated (a new vector with x 0.2, y 0.3 and z 0.4) scaled (a new vector with x 2.0, y 3.0 and z 4.0)
set transform to a UI scene transform from (the UI scene matrix for pose)
set point to the UI scene position of (a new vector with x 0.3, y 0.7 and z -0.2) through transform
check model point point equals (a new vector with x 0.5102840813609375, y 4.260935997598972 and z 2.7584493142368682)
set {integer vector} to a new vector with x 1, y 2 and z 3
set pose to a UI scene pose at integer vector rotated origin scaled one
check model point (pose's position) equals (a new vector with x 1.0, y 2.0 and z 3.0)

set red to a UI scene material with color (UI ink from RGB 13072963) roughness 0.78 metalness 0.2
check model number (red's color's red) equals 199.0
check model number (red's color's green) equals 122.0
check model number (red's color's blue) equals 67.0
check model number (red's opacity) equals 1.0
check model number (red's emission strength) equals 0.0
set {wide color} to UI ink from RGB (16777215 as a 128 bit integer)
require condition ((wide color's red = 255) and ((wide color's green = 255) and (wide color's blue = 255))) reporting "A valid wide RGB value was narrowed before conversion."
set blue to a UI scene material with color (UI ink 50 100 200) roughness 0.3 metalness 0.7
set mesh to a UI box mesh with 1 by 1 by 1 segments
set parts to [
    a UI scene group named "root" under -1 at (a UI scene pose at (a new vector with x 10.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0) rotated origin scaled one),
    a UI scene mesh part named "arm" under 0 using mesh with material red at (a UI scene pose at (a new vector with x 0.0, y 2.0 and z 0.0) rotated origin scaled one),
    a UI scene group named "hand" under 1 at (a UI scene pose at (a new vector with x 1.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0) rotated origin scaled one),
    a UI scene mesh part named "tip" under 2 using mesh with material red at (a UI scene pose at (a new vector with x 0.5, y 0.0 and z 0.0) rotated origin scaled (one * 0.2)),
    a UI scene mesh part named "other" under -1 using mesh with material red at (a UI scene pose at (a new vector with x 100.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0) rotated origin scaled one)
]
set model to a UI scene model from parts
require condition ((the index of UI scene part named "hand" under 1 in model) = 2) reporting "A model lost a named articulation pivot."
set first to a UI scene instance of model
set second to a UI scene instance of model
require condition (first's revision = 1) reporting "An initial model instance did not compute its placements once."
set placement to the UI scene placement of part 3 in first
check model point (the UI scene position of origin through (placement's transform)) equals (a new vector with x 11.5, y 2.0 and z 0.0)
require condition (placement's visible) reporting "A visible child was hidden during placement."
require condition (first's extent's present) reporting "A nonempty instance has no bounds."
check model number (first's extent's bounds' minimum's x) equals 9.5
check model number (first's extent's bounds' maximum's x) equals 100.5
refresh UI scene instance first
require condition (first's revision = 1) reporting "An unchanged scene instance was recomputed."

set pose to (the item at 1 in parts)'s pose
set pose's rotation to a new vector with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 1.5707963267948966
set UI scene pose of part 1 in first to pose
set placement to the UI scene placement of part 3 in first
check model point (the UI scene position of origin through (placement's transform)) equals (a new vector with x 10.0, y 3.5 and z 0.0)
require condition ((first's revision = 2) and (placement's revision = 2)) reporting "A pivot edit did not update its descendants once."
require condition ((the UI scene placement of part 4 in first)'s revision = 1) reporting "An unrelated scene branch was recomputed."
set placement to the UI scene placement of part 3 in second
check model point (the UI scene position of origin through (placement's transform)) equals (a new vector with x 11.5, y 2.0 and z 0.0)
set UI scene pose of part 1 in first to pose
refresh UI scene instance first
require condition (first's revision = 2) reporting "Assigning an unchanged pose invalidated the scene."

set UI scene material of part 1 in first to blue
refresh UI scene instance first
require condition (((the item at 1 in (first's materials))'s color's blue = 200) and ((the item at 1 in (second's materials))'s color's blue = 67)) reporting "A material override changed another instance."
require condition ((the item at 1 in model's parts)'s material's color's blue = 67) reporting "An instance changed its immutable prototype."
set UI scene material of part 1 in first to blue
refresh UI scene instance first
require condition (first's revision = 3) reporting "Assigning an unchanged material invalidated the scene."

set ray to a new UI scene ray
set ray's origin to a new vector with x 10.0, y 2.0 and z 10.0
set ray's direction to a new vector with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z -2.0
set selection to the UI scene selection from ray in first including backfaces false
require condition ((selection's hit's hit) and (selection's part = 1)) reporting "Instance picking lost the nearest visible part."
check model number (selection's hit's distance) equals 9.5
set UI scene pickability of part 1 in first to false
set selection to the UI scene selection from ray in first including backfaces false
require condition ((selection's hit's hit) = false) reporting "Picking selected a noninteractive scene branch."
require condition (((the UI scene placement of part 3 in first)'s pickable) = false) reporting "Pickability did not propagate to descendants."
set UI scene pickability of part 1 in first to true
set UI scene visibility of part 1 in first to false
set placement to the UI scene placement of part 3 in first
require condition ((placement's visible) = false) reporting "A hidden pivot left a visible descendant."
set selection to the UI scene selection from ray in first including backfaces false
require condition ((selection's hit's hit) = false) reporting "Picking selected a hidden scene branch."
require condition ((the UI scene placement of part 3 in second)'s visible) reporting "Instance visibility changed its sibling instance."
set UI scene visibility of part 4 in first to false
refresh UI scene instance first
require condition ((first's extent's present) = false) reporting "An instance with no visible geometry retained its bounds."
set UI scene visibility of part 1 in first to true
set UI scene root pose in first to (a UI scene pose at (a new vector with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 5.0) rotated origin scaled one)
set placement to the UI scene placement of part 3 in first
check model point (the UI scene position of origin through (placement's transform)) equals (a new vector with x 10.0, y 3.5 and z 5.0)
set model to a new UI scene model
require condition ((the length of first's model's parts) = 5) reporting "A prototype's storage did not survive its caller."
require condition ((the index of UI scene part named "hand" under 1 in (first's model)) = 2) reporting "An instance lost its prototype's owned part names."
close UI scene instance first
close UI scene instance second
set empty to a UI scene instance of model
require condition ((empty's extent's present) = false) reporting "An empty scene prototype produced geometry."
close UI scene instance empty
print line "Scene models share immutable parts, independent articulated instances, incremental placements, materials, inherited visibility, bounds and picking."
